The overprint position deviation is between the upper and lower limit positions confirmed by both parties (≤±0.1mm), and there is no ghosting.
The size of the text is similar to the standard sample, no hyphenation, slack, no gaps, and no influence on recognition
03 Basic requirements for hose product structure
Specifications and dimensions: Measured with a vernier caliper according to the requirements of the design drawing, and the tolerance is within the specified range of the drawing: the maximum allowable deviation of the diameter is 0.5mm; the maximum allowable deviation of the length is 1.5mm; the maximum allowable deviation of the thickness is 0.05mm;
Weight requirements: Measure with a balance with an accuracy of 0.1g, and the standard value and allowable error are within the agreed range of both parties: the maximum allowable deviation is 10% of the weight of the standard sample;
Mouthful capacity: After filling the container with water at 20℃ and the mouth of the container is level, the filling water quality represents the container’s mouthful capacity, the standard value and error range are within the agreed range of both parties: the maximum allowable deviation is the standard sample’s mouthful capacity 5%;
Thickness uniformity (suitable for hoses with a content of 50ML or more): Cut the container and use a thickness gauge to measure 5 places on the upper, middle and lower sides, and the maximum allowable deviation is not more than 0.05mm
Material requirements: According to the materials stipulated in the contract signed by the supplier and the demander, the inspection shall be carried out with reference to the corresponding national industry standards, which is consistent with the sealing sample.
05 Coordination requirements of hoses and accessories
After fitting, the hose and cover will not be skewed.
After the hose cover is matched, the gap is uniform, and the gap is unobstructed by touching the gap with your hand. The maximum gap is within the range confirmed by both parties (≤0.2mm).
Fill the container with water according to the net content specified in the container, and place it flat at 40 ℃ for 24 hours after tightening the cap, without leakage;
After the hose is installed with about 9/10 of the maximum capacity of water, cover the matching cover (with an inner plug should be equipped with an inner plug) and put it in the vacuum dryer to vacuum up to -0.08MPa and keep it for 3 minutes without cracking or leakage.
No rupture of the tube or cover, no tail burst, no end breakage
Drop test: Load the contents of the specified capacity, close the lid, and fall freely to the cement floor from a height of 120cm. There will be no cracks, tail bursts, leaks, no hoses, tight lids, and no loose lids.
Yellowing test: Put the hose under ultraviolet light for 24h or 1 week in the sun, and it is qualified if there is no obvious discoloration compared with the standard sample.
Compatibility test: Pour the content into the hose or soak the test piece in the content, and place it at 48°C and -15°C for 4 weeks. No change in the hose or test piece and the content is considered qualified.
Contents influence: Use a finger dipped in the content to rub back and forth 20 times, and the content does not change color and the ink does not fall off.
Silk screen, hose surface, bronzing: 1 batch for every 10 batches, 10 samples are randomly selected from each batch of materials, and soaked in 70% alcohol for 30 minutes, the surface of the hose does not fall off, and the failure rate is ≤1/10.
